      "connection_topology": {
        "component_connections": "CANReceiver publishes parsed signals to ControlLogic via IF_CAN_to_Control (sender-receiver). ControlLogic publishes motor commands to ActuatorDriver via IF_Control_to_Actuator (sender-receiver). ControlLogic invokes diagnostic RPCs on ActuatorDriver via IF_Diagnostic (client-server).",
        "data_flow_paths": "CAN bus -> CANReceiver -> [IF_CAN_to_Control] -> ControlLogic -> [IF_Control_to_Actuator] -> ActuatorDriver -> PWM outputs. Diagnostic path: ControlLogic -> [IF_Diagnostic] -> ActuatorDriver -> status response.",
        "control_flow_paths": "Control loop triggered by ControlLogic TIMING-EVENT (10ms). CANReceiver triggers data updates on CAN events. ActuatorDriver applies PWM on TIMING-EVENT (1ms) or upon new command."
      },
      "architecture_rationale": {
        "design_decisions": "采用三组件分层：接收层(CANReceiver)、控制层(ControlLogic)、驱动层(ActuatorDriver)。通过明确的Sender-Receiver接口分离数据流与生命周期，通过Client-Server接口实现诊断服务。控制频率设为10ms满足常见中速电机控制需求，PWM由ActuatorDriver以更高频率管理以隔离硬件细节。",
        "tradeoff_analysis": "将PID置于ControlLogic提供可调节性与可测试性，但增加了与ActuatorDriver的实时依赖；选择最新值覆盖减少延迟和内存成本，但在高丢帧场景可能需要额外保守策略；诊断采用同步RPC便于实现确定性状态查询，但会占用调用线程等待响应，故设置超时与重试策略。",
        "alternative_considerations": "可将PID下放至ActuatorDriver以减少总线通信和控制延时（更低级实现）；或将CAN解析与控制合并为一组件以减少接口开销，但降低模块化和可测试性；对于高性能需求可采用更高频率控制（<1ms），但需评估CPU与通信负载。",
        "risk_assessment": "主要风险为实时性不足（CPU或CAN总线拥塞）导致控制环打破；诊断同步调用阻塞可能导致控制周期延长；ActuatorDriver硬件故障需明确安全停机策略。缓解措施: 监控延迟并降级策略、在关键路径使用最新值覆盖并检测超时、对诊断调用设置明确超时并在超时后采取安全动作。"
      },
